        "[F#m/C#]Now be the [A]song of [D]praise begun. [A/E]Alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D/A]The pow'rs of death [Em/B]have [D/A]done their [F#m]worst,",
        "[A]But Christ their legions [G/D]has dispersed.",
        "[F#m/C#]Let shouts of [A]holy [D]joy outburst. [A/E]Alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D/A]The three sad days [Em/B]have [D/A]quickly [F#m]sped,",
        "[A]He rises glorious [G/D]from the dead.",
        "[F#m/C#]All glory [A]to our [D]risen [A/E]head! Alleluia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D/A]Lord, by the stripes [Em/B]which [D/A]wounded [F#m]You,",
        "[A]From death's sting free [G/D]Your servants too,",
        "[F#m/C#]That we may [A]live and [D]sing to [A/E]You. Alleluia!"
      ]
